OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 6 Aug to Sat 15 AugFA
OL,6,Fgenerally changeable period looks
OL,7,Flikely and many places are likely to
OL,8,Fsee some rain or showers at times,
OL,9,Finterspersed with drier and sunnier
OL,10,Fspells. Many areas will start with a
OL,11,Ffew drier days, although there will be
OL,12,Fsome showers in the north. There is,
OL,13,Fhowever, a chance that deeper low
OL,14,Fpressure brings more widespread
OL,15,Funsettled conditions for a time. Into
OL,16,Fmid August more changeable or
OL,17,Funsettled conditions probably become
OL,18,Fprevalent. This may be due to Atlantic
OL,19,Ffrontal systems or thundery plumes
OL,20,Fmoving north from the continent or a
OL,21,Fcombination of both. Temperatures will
OL,22,Flikely be a little above average, and
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fthere is the potential for some very
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fwarm or hot and humid spells,
OL,25,Fespecially in the south, although
OL,26,Fperhaps not the heat we have seen in
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
